{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "Gatecrasher",
          "version": "dev",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/yarrasatwik/gatecrasher",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "TRAIT_FORGERY",
              "name": "ClientTraitForgery",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A client-supplied trait unlocks a protected flag."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Anyone holding the public client key can send arbitrary identity traits. A segment that trusts those traits can be satisfied by an attacker, unlocking features or controls they should not reach."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Anyone holding the public client key can send arbitrary identity traits. A segment that trusts those traits can be satisfied by an attacker, unlocking features or controls they should not reach.\n\nFix: Do not use client-writable traits for entitlement or access control. Turn off allow_client_traits, or decide segments from server-verified data only.",
                "markdown": "**A client-supplied trait unlocks a protected flag.**\n\nAnyone holding the public client key can send arbitrary identity traits. A segment that trusts those traits can be satisfied by an attacker, unlocking features or controls they should not reach.\n\n**Fix:** Do not use client-writable traits for entitlement or access control. Turn off allow_client_traits, or decide segments from server-verified data only."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "9.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "PERCENTAGE_REROLL",
              "name": "PercentageRolloutReroll",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "An attacker can pick an identifier that lands inside a percentage rollout."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Percentage splits hash the identifier. When the client chooses its own identifier it can try values until it falls inside the rollout."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Percentage splits hash the identifier. When the client chooses its own identifier it can try values until it falls inside the rollout.\n\nFix: Assign identifiers on the server and evaluate flags server-side for gated features.",
                "markdown": "**An attacker can pick an identifier that lands inside a percentage rollout.**\n\nPercentage splits hash the identifier. When the client chooses its own identifier it can try values until it falls inside the rollout.\n\n**Fix:** Assign identifiers on the server and evaluate flags server-side for gated features."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "VARIANT_REROLL",
              "name": "VariantReroll",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "An attacker can re-roll a multivariate variant."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Variant assignment is derived from a client-chosen identifier, so an attacker can search for the variant they want."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Variant assignment is derived from a client-chosen identifier, so an attacker can search for the variant they want.\n\nFix: Assign identifiers on the server and evaluate experiment flags server-side.",
                "markdown": "**An attacker can re-roll a multivariate variant.**\n\nVariant assignment is derived from a client-chosen identifier, so an attacker can search for the variant they want.\n\n**Fix:** Assign identifiers on the server and evaluate experiment flags server-side."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "EXPERIMENT_RIGGING",
              "name": "ExperimentRigging",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "An experiment on a revenue flag can be steered by the client."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The client can choose the variant of a pricing or checkout experiment, which skews results and can unlock cheaper offers."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The client can choose the variant of a pricing or checkout experiment, which skews results and can unlock cheaper offers.\n\nFix: Bucket users on the server and do not expose experiment assignment to client-controlled input.",
                "markdown": "**An experiment on a revenue flag can be steered by the client.**\n\nThe client can choose the variant of a pricing or checkout experiment, which skews results and can unlock cheaper offers.\n\n**Fix:** Bucket users on the server and do not expose experiment assignment to client-controlled input."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "IDENTITY_TRAIT_LEAK",
              "name": "IdentityTraitLeak",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Identity lookups return stored traits."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Requesting an identity with any identifier returns the traits stored for it, which can disclose other users' data."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Requesting an identity with any identifier returns the traits stored for it, which can disclose other users' data.\n\nFix: Enable hide_sensitive_data for the environment and stop storing sensitive traits in Flagsmith.",
                "markdown": "**Identity lookups return stored traits.**\n\nRequesting an identity with any identifier returns the traits stored for it, which can disclose other users' data.\n\n**Fix:** Enable hide_sensitive_data for the environment and stop storing sensitive traits in Flagsmith."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "IDENTITY_OVERRIDE_LEAK",
              "name": "IdentityOverrideLeak",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Per-identity overrides are visible to clients."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Flag values targeted at specific identities can be read by anyone who can guess the identifier."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Flag values targeted at specific identities can be read by anyone who can guess the identifier.\n\nFix: Avoid identity overrides for sensitive flags, or serve them to servers only.",
                "markdown": "**Per-identity overrides are visible to clients.**\n\nFlag values targeted at specific identities can be read by anyone who can guess the identifier.\n\n**Fix:** Avoid identity overrides for sensitive flags, or serve them to servers only."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SECRET_IN_CLIENT_VALUE",
              "name": "SecretInClientValue",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A secret is served in a client-visible flag value."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flag value contains credential material that every holder of the public client key can read."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A flag value contains credential material that every holder of the public client key can read.\n\nFix: Rotate the secret immediately, remove it from the flag and keep secrets out of Flagsmith.",
                "markdown": "**A secret is served in a client-visible flag value.**\n\nA flag value contains credential material that every holder of the public client key can read.\n\n**Fix:** Rotate the secret immediately, remove it from the flag and keep secrets out of Flagsmith."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "9.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "INTERNAL_URL_LEAK",
              "name": "InternalUrlLeak",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "An internal URL is served in a client-visible flag."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The flag value reveals internal hostnames or admin endpoints, which helps attackers map the infrastructure."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The flag value reveals internal hostnames or admin endpoints, which helps attackers map the infrastructure.\n\nFix: Remove internal URLs from client-visible flags or mark the flag server-side only.",
                "markdown": "**An internal URL is served in a client-visible flag.**\n\nThe flag value reveals internal hostnames or admin endpoints, which helps attackers map the infrastructure.\n\n**Fix:** Remove internal URLs from client-visible flags or mark the flag server-side only."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "UNRELEASED_PRODUCT_LEAK",
              "name": "UnreleasedProductLeak",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Unreleased product details are visible in client flags."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Flag names or values reveal products or features that have not been announced."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Flag names or values reveal products or features that have not been announced.\n\nFix: Rename pre-launch flags to neutral names and mark them server-side only.",
                "markdown": "**Unreleased product details are visible in client flags.**\n\nFlag names or values reveal products or features that have not been announced.\n\n**Fix:** Rename pre-launch flags to neutral names and mark them server-side only."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "PRICING_LEAK",
              "name": "PricingLeak",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Pricing data is served in a client-visible flag."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The flag value exposes price tables or discount rules that were meant to stay private."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The flag value exposes price tables or discount rules that were meant to stay private.\n\nFix: Move pricing data to a server-only flag or your backend.",
                "markdown": "**Pricing data is served in a client-visible flag.**\n\nThe flag value exposes price tables or discount rules that were meant to stay private.\n\n**Fix:** Move pricing data to a server-only flag or your backend."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "PII_IN_CLIENT_VALUE",
              "name": "PiiInClientValue",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Personal data is served in a client-visible flag."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A flag value contains personal data such as an email address or phone number."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "A flag value contains personal data such as an email address or phone number.\n\nFix: Remove personal data from flag values and mark the flag server-side only.",
                "markdown": "**Personal data is served in a client-visible flag.**\n\nA flag value contains personal data such as an email address or phone number.\n\n**Fix:** Remove personal data from flag values and mark the flag server-side only."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SETTING_CLIENT_TRAITS_ON",
              "name": "ClientTraitsEnabled",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The environment accepts traits written by client keys."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "allow_client_traits is on, so any holder of the public client key can write identity traits."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "allow_client_traits is on, so any holder of the public client key can write identity traits.\n\nFix: Disable allow_client_traits for the environment.",
                "markdown": "**The environment accepts traits written by client keys.**\n\nallow_client_traits is on, so any holder of the public client key can write identity traits.\n\n**Fix:** Disable allow_client_traits for the environment."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SETTING_SENSITIVE_DATA_VISIBLE",
              "name": "SensitiveDataVisible",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Sensitive data is visible to client keys."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "hide_sensitive_data is off, so client keys can read data that should be restricted to servers."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "hide_sensitive_data is off, so client keys can read data that should be restricted to servers.\n\nFix: Enable hide_sensitive_data for the environment.",
                "markdown": "**Sensitive data is visible to client keys.**\n\nhide_sensitive_data is off, so client keys can read data that should be restricted to servers.\n\n**Fix:** Enable hide_sensitive_data for the environment."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "FLAG_NOT_SERVER_ONLY",
              "name": "FlagNotServerOnly",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A sensitive flag is not restricted to server-side keys."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The flag is returned to client keys although it does not need to be."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The flag is returned to client keys although it does not need to be.\n\nFix: Mark the flag as server-side only.",
                "markdown": "**A sensitive flag is not restricted to server-side keys.**\n\nThe flag is returned to client keys although it does not need to be.\n\n**Fix:** Mark the flag as server-side only."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "SEGMENT_FORGEABLE",
              "name": "SegmentForgeable",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A segment can be matched using client-supplied traits."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The segment rules depend only on traits a client can set, so an attacker can join the segment on demand."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "The segment rules depend only on traits a client can set, so an attacker can join the segment on demand.\n\nFix: Base segment rules on server-controlled traits or identifiers.",
                "markdown": "**A segment can be matched using client-supplied traits.**\n\nThe segment rules depend only on traits a client can set, so an attacker can join the segment on demand.\n\n**Fix:** Base segment rules on server-controlled traits or identifiers."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "5.5",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CONTROL_OK",
              "name": "ControlOk",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A control is correctly configured."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "This is informational: the control was tested and behaves as intended."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "This is informational: the control was tested and behaves as intended.\n\nFix: No action needed.",
                "markdown": "**A control is correctly configured.**\n\nThis is informational: the control was tested and behaves as intended.\n\n**Fix:** No action needed."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "precision": "high",
                "security-severity": "0.0",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "feature-flags",
                  "flagsmith"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
